PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent (#00000000)
Stroke: 4px Black (#000000FF)
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White (#FFFFFFFF)
Grid: 100px major, 20px minor, 20% opacity

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Objects
    - Three manifold icons: M1, M2, M3
    - Smooth curved shapes, 6px stroke
  L2: Morphisms
    - Arrows between manifolds labeled f, g, h
    - Smooth-map arrows: curved, 4px stroke
  L3: Labels
    - "Category 𝙎𝙢𝙤𝙤𝙩𝙝"
    - "Objects: Smooth Manifolds"
    - "Morphisms: Smooth Maps"
  L4: Annotation Overlay
    - Commutative triangle with f ∘ g = h

Export:
  PNG (RGBA), sRGB
